* A1_conventional_cascode_mirror, testbench A_out
* LTspice netlist (PTM 90 nm). Open in LTspice (File > Open, all files) and Run.
* Output characteristic at Iin = 10 uA: plot -I(Vo) against Vo. Rout from the slope at 0.5 V (for a cleaner number use .ac on Vo).
.include ptm90.lib
Vdd vdd 0 1
Vcn vcn 0 0.42
Vo out 0 0.5
M1C y vcn x 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M1 x y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2C out vcn x2 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
M2 x2 y 0 0 nmos90 W=10u L=360n
Vjoin inn y 0
Iin 0 inn 10u AC 1
.dc Vo 0 1 5m
.meas DC iout_0p5 FIND -I(Vo) AT=0.5
.meas DC gout DERIV I(Vo) AT=0.5
.meas DC rout_ohm PARAM 1/abs(gout)
.backanno
.end
